            "value": "客户端公钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the host uses an allow list, add this key to allow.list in the folder from herdr plugin config-dir herdr.tailcat (one key per line), then run: herdr plugin action invoke herdr.tailcat.restart. All tailcat devices on this phone share this key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the host uses an allow list, add this key to allow.list in the folder from herdr plugin config-dir herdr.tailcat (one key per line), then run: herdr plugin action invoke herdr.tailcat.restart. All tailcat devices on this phone share this key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若开发机使用允许列表，请通过 herdr plugin config-dir herdr.tailcat 找到配置目录，将此公钥加入 allow.list（每行一个公钥），再运行 herdr plugin action invoke herdr.tailcat.restart。本手机的所有 Tailcat 开发机共用此密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
